# obs_invisibility (bsrl-sim issue #19, obs v5.9): the observation encoder (native/loader/encode.c) leaves out an
# invisible enemy brawler beyond its reveal distance (status Invisibility char +0x97c, Leon's super until he attacks;
# env.c invis_reach fills EncState.invis per player). Applies on top of status_movement.patch (paths relative to engine/).
# Re-recorded for the linear chain (series): applies with -p1 on the tree the patches before it in series leave.
